Unmodified except q31.hpp: __arm__ paths for multiply (64-bit product >> 31,
the portable path's floor without its division) and add (qadd). Same results
as upstream's portable path (emu/voicecost.py checks against it).

src/ is ours: voice.hpp wraps a module as an mdkit_voice (drums) or a
pitched_voice (synths), gnd.cpp lists the GND machines, mm.cpp the
Monomachine ones, common.cpp holds what all modules share.
